def author(c,s,m,a):
 def project(cid,context,times,facts,place,marks,keys=None):
  z,e=context.split('~');ts=[{'year':y,'event':v} for y,v in times]
  hz=' '.join(v.split('~')[0] for _,v in times);he=' '.join(v.split('~')[1] for _,v in times)
  history=z+hz+'本課從公開構造辨認荷載、能量與功能之間的關係，另以自訂尺寸做守恆與極限算例。啟用、首次運轉和後續維護是不同里程碑；課程不將新聞日期當成施工日期，也不以比較用的地標暗示相同設備或相同操作規則。~'+e+' '+he+' The course uses published configurations to distinguish loads, energy and system function, with separately assumed dimensions for conservation and limit calculations. Opening, first operation and later maintenance are different milestones. Publication dates are not substituted for construction events, and comparison landmarks do not imply identical equipment or operating rules.'
  pz,pe,cz,ce,lat,lng,q=place
  m(cid,history=history,timeline=ts,facts=facts,place={'name':pz+'~'+pe,'country':cz+'~'+ce,'lat':lat,'lng':lng,'query':q},landmarks=marks,codes=['美國陸軍工兵團工程手冊：水工鋼結構設計，EM 1110-2-2107~USACE Design of Hydraulic Steel Structures, EM 1110-2-2107','美國陸軍工兵團土木工程機電設計手冊，EM 1110-2-2610，2025~USACE Mechanical and Electrical Design for Civil Works Structures, EM 1110-2-2610, 2025'],**({'vendorKeys':keys} if keys else {}))
 project('b221','東斯海爾德防潮閘位於荷蘭澤蘭，以平常保持開口、風暴時形成屏障的方式，兼顧潮汐環境與防洪需求。~The Eastern Scheldt Barrier in Zeeland combines normally open tidal exchange with storm protection, making ecological exchange and structural loading inseparable engineering questions.',[('1953','北海大洪水促成荷蘭強化防洪的三角洲工程計畫。~The North Sea flood prompts the Netherlands to strengthen protection through the Delta Works.'),('1976','東斯海爾德防潮閘工程開始建設，後續保留開放潮汐設計。~Construction begins on the Eastern Scheldt Barrier with an open tidal configuration.'),('1986','東斯海爾德防潮閘完成，形成長期海口防護設施。~The Eastern Scheldt Barrier is completed as a long-term estuary protection structure.')],['官方全長9 km，其中約3 km為可關閉段。~Official length is 9 km, with approximately 3 km closable.','官方構造包含65座墩與62座閘門。~The official configuration includes 65 piers and 62 gates.','教學6000 m³/s除3000 m²得到平均2 m/s。~Teaching discharge 6000 m³/s over 3000 m² gives mean velocity 2 m/s.','教學25 kPa作用200 m²產生5000 kN上浮。~Teaching pressure 25 kPa over 200 m² produces 5000 kN uplift.','教學縮尺25:1的弗勞德時間比為5:1。~A teaching Froude length ratio 25:1 gives time ratio 5:1.','教學20 mm板均勻腐蝕15年後為18.8 mm。~A teaching 20 mm plate after fifteen years of assumed uniform corrosion is 18.8 mm.'],('東斯海爾德防潮閘','Eastern Scheldt Barrier','荷蘭','Netherlands',51.631,3.705,'Oosterscheldekering Neeltje Jans Netherlands'),['東斯海爾德防潮閘：開放海口比較~Eastern Scheldt Barrier: open-estuary context','馬仕朗防潮閘：浮運閘門比較~Maeslant Barrier: floating-gate comparison'])
 project('b222','馬仕朗防潮閘在鹿特丹外港航道兩岸配置大型活動門體，與哈特爾防潮閘及堤防共同形成區域防線。~The Maeslant Barrier places large movable gates beside the Rotterdam approach waterway and works with the Hartel Barrier and dykes as a regional defence.',[('1991','馬仕朗防潮閘開始建設，保留主要航道平時開放。~Construction begins on the Maeslant Barrier while preserving an open main navigation route.'),('1997','馬仕朗防潮閘建設完成，成為歐洲港防線的一部分。~The Maeslant Barrier is completed as part of the Europoort defence system.'),('2007','官方記載馬仕朗防潮閘首次因風暴而關閉防護。~The owner records the first storm-protection closure of the Maeslant Barrier.')],['官方兩座門體各寬210 m、高22 m。~The two official gate structures are each 210 m wide and 22 m high.','官方球接頭直徑10 m，課堂不據此推定容許反力。~Official spherical-joint diameter is 10 m, without inferring allowable reactions.','教學600 t壓載使固定水線面平均吃水增加0.4878 m。~Teaching ballast of 600 t increases mean draft by 0.4878 m at fixed waterplane area.','教學8 MN力乘60 m力臂為480 MN·m。~Teaching force 8 MN times lever arm 60 m gives 480 MN·m.','教學共同原因模型失效機率為0.005398。~The teaching common-cause model gives failure probability 0.005398.','教學資料延遲4 min乘水位速率0.12 m/min為0.48 m。~Teaching latency 4 min times rise rate 0.12 m/min gives 0.48 m.'],('馬仕朗活動防潮閘','Maeslant storm-surge barrier','荷蘭','Netherlands',51.955,4.163,'Maeslantkering Hoek van Holland'),['馬仕朗防潮閘：球鉸支臂案例~Maeslant Barrier: spherical-joint arm context','東斯海爾德防潮閘：垂直閘門比較~Eastern Scheldt Barrier: vertical-gate comparison'],['rws-maeslant','hollandia-maeslant'])
 project('b223','泰晤士河防洪閘以橫跨河道的活動閘門保護倫敦，與上游河流、兩岸防線及河口潮汐共同作用。~The Thames Barrier protects London through movable gates across the river, interacting with upstream flow, bank defences and estuarine tides.',[('1974','泰晤士河防洪閘開始建設，進入河口大型活動結構施工階段。~Construction of the Thames Barrier begins, establishing the movable estuary structure.'),('1982','泰晤士河防洪閘開始具備實際運轉防洪功能。~The Thames Barrier becomes operational for practical flood protection.'),('1984','五月八日正式啟用典禮，與開始運轉年份有所區別。~Formal opening takes place on May eight, distinct from the operational starting year.')],['官方防洪閘橫跨約520 m河道。~The official barrier spans approximately 520 m of river.','官方系統共有10座鋼製閘門。~The official system comprises 10 steel gates.','教學旋轉門分項力矩合成為4.5 MN·m。~Teaching component moments combine to 4.5 MN·m.','教學300 m³/s淨入流持續2 h使平均水位上升0.108 m。~Teaching inflow 300 m³/s for two hours raises mean level 0.108 m.','教學三角力脈衝衝量為0.4 MN·s。~The teaching triangular force pulse has impulse 0.4 MN·s.','教學40年線性海平面情境增量0.20 m。~The teaching forty-year linear sea-level scenario adds 0.20 m.'],('泰晤士河活動防洪閘','Thames movable flood barrier','英國','United Kingdom',51.497,-.037,'Thames Barrier London'),['泰晤士河防洪閘：旋轉門體~Thames Barrier: rotating-gate context','馬仕朗防潮閘：航道閉合比較~Maeslant Barrier: navigation-closure comparison'])
 project('b224','威尼斯MOSE在潟湖海口配置多組浮動翻板，讓防潮、通航和潟湖環境成為彼此牽動的系統問題。~Venice MOSE places groups of buoyant flap gates at lagoon inlets, coupling flood exclusion, navigation and the lagoon environment.',[('2020-07','七月十日全部七十八座閘門試升，不等同全部工程竣工。~All seventy-eight gates rise in the July ten test, distinct from full project completion.'),('2020-10','十月三日市政府記錄首次實際防潮事件。~The municipality records the first actual flood-protection event on October three.'),('2025','美國工兵團出版機電設計手冊作本課技術比較，並非威尼斯事件。~USACE publishes mechanical-electrical guidance used for comparison, not a Venice project event.')],['官方試升共78座閘門，分布於4組屏障。~The official full test covers 78 gates in four barrier groups.','官方Lido兩組為21與20門，Malamocco19門、Chioggia18門。~Official groups comprise Lido 21 and 20, Malamocco 19 and Chioggia 18 gates.','教學8 m海水深對應表壓80.442 kPa。~Teaching seawater depth 8 m corresponds to gauge pressure 80.442 kPa.','教學壓比2的理想等溫壓縮功率138.63 kW。~Teaching pressure ratio two gives ideal isothermal compression power 138.63 kW.','教學濕態小振幅模型週期12.566 s。~The teaching small-motion wet model has period 12.566 s.','教學兩片門相位差120度時相對振幅0.06928 m。~Teaching gate phase difference 120 degrees gives relative amplitude 0.06928 m.'],('威尼斯麗都海口防潮閘','Venice Lido inlet barriers','義大利','Italy',45.424,12.421,'MOSE Lido inlet Venice'),['威尼斯MOSE：浮動翻板案例~Venice MOSE: buoyant-flap context','馬仕朗防潮閘：壓載浮門比較~Maeslant Barrier: ballasted-gate comparison'],['mose-test','abb-mose'])
 project('b225','濱海堤壩在新加坡市中心把淡水蓄存、防洪排水與公共空間結合，低潮重力排水與高潮抽水對應不同邊界條件。~Marina Barrage combines freshwater storage, urban drainage and public space in Singapore, with different boundary conditions for low-tide gravity flow and high-tide pumping.',[('2008','十月三十一日濱海堤壩正式開放，形成新加坡第十五座水庫。~Marina Barrage officially opens on October thirty-one, forming Singapores fifteenth reservoir.'),('2022','水工鋼結構設計指引出版，作活動閘門的技術比較資料。~Hydraulic steel-structure guidance is published as a technical comparison for movable gates.'),('2025','機電設計指引更新，作抽水與備援觀念的教育參照。~Mechanical-electrical guidance is updated as educational context for pumping and redundancy.')],['PUB列明濱海堤壩包含9座排水閘門。~PUB identifies 9 drainage crest gates at Marina Barrage.','正式開放日期為2008年10月31日。~The official opening date is October 31, 2008.','教學2 km²小集水區合理化峰值25.02 m³/s。~The teaching two-square-kilometre catchment rational peak is 25.02 m³/s.','教學20 m³/s抽水在3 m揚程需735.75 kW輸入。~Teaching pumping 20 m³/s at 3 m head needs input 735.75 kW.','教學兩泵並聯與系統交點總流量32.66 m³/s。~The teaching two-pump system intersection gives total flow 32.66 m³/s.','教學完全混合平均停留時間23.15 days。~The teaching complete-mixing mean residence time is 23.15 days.'],('新加坡濱海水庫堤壩','Singapore Marina reservoir barrage','新加坡','Singapore',1.281,103.872,'Marina Barrage Singapore'),['新加坡濱海堤壩：城市水庫~Marina Barrage: urban-reservoir context','威尼斯MOSE：海口關閉比較~Venice MOSE: inlet-closure comparison'])
 project('b226','巴拿馬運河擴建新船閘把大型滾動門與節水池整合，本課承接既有概念課並深化有限水池均衡、密度交換與非恆定荷載。~The expanded Panama Canal locks integrate rolling gates and saving basins. This course extends earlier conceptual lessons with finite-pool equalization, density exchange and transient loading.',[('2016-02','二月首座阿瓜克拉拉節水池充水，進入系統測試階段。~The first Agua Clara saving basin is filled in February for system testing.'),('2016-06','六月二十六日擴建運河正式啟用，開始新船閘服務。~The expanded canal officially opens on June twenty-six, beginning new-lock service.'),('2025','機電設計指引提供比較框架，此節點為手冊出版而非運河改建。~Mechanical-electrical guidance provides comparison context; this is a publication milestone, not a canal reconstruction.')],['官方新閘室尺寸為427 m長、55 m寬、18.3 m深。~Official new chambers measure 427 m long, 55 m wide and 18.3 m deep.','官方回用說明為每次通行水量的60%，需保留原分母。~The official reuse statement is 60 percent per transit and requires its original denominator.','教學有限水池均衡水位為8 m。~The teaching finite-pool equilibrium level is 8 m.','教學50000 t船舶在0.0002坡度下推力98.1 kN。~A teaching 50000 t vessel on slope 0.0002 experiences force 98.1 kN.','教學快速水錘壓力增量240 kPa。~The teaching rapid-waterhammer increment is 240 kPa.','教學交換量與損失假設得到85000 m³補水。~The teaching exchange and loss assumptions give makeup 85000 m³.'],('巴拿馬阿瓜克拉拉新船閘','Panama Agua Clara new locks','巴拿馬','Panama',9.279,-79.918,'Agua Clara Locks Panama'),['巴拿馬擴建船閘：節水池案例~Expanded Panama locks: saving-basin context','三峽升船機：升降船廂比較~Three Gorges ship lift: caisson comparison'])
 project('b227','三峽升船機採用齒輪齒條提升和配重系統，公開資料可用來辨認長行程船廂的多點同步與高程銜接問題。~The Three Gorges ship lift uses rack-and-pinion lifting with counterweights, providing public context for multi-point synchronization and docking over a long vertical travel.',[('2007','十月升船機續建工程恢復施工，後續進行設備安裝與整合。~Ship-lift construction resumes in October before subsequent installation and integration.'),('2016','九月十八日開始試通航，與後續正式竣工驗收區分。~Trial navigation begins on September eighteen, distinct from later completion acceptance.'),('2019','十二月二十七日竣工驗收，形成工程階段的另一里程碑。~Completion acceptance occurs on December twenty-seven as a separate project milestone.')],['官方最大提升高度113 m。~The official maximum lift is 113 m.','官方船廂含水提升重量約15500 t。~Official lifted caisson mass including water is approximately 15500 t.','教學2000 t浮船排開2000 m³淡水。~A teaching 2000 t floating vessel displaces 2000 m³ freshwater.','教學100 t不平衡在0.2 m/s需196.2 kW重力功率。~Teaching imbalance 100 t at 0.2 m/s requires gravity power 196.2 kW.','教學20 m支距高差4 mm相當0.0002 rad。~Teaching 4 mm difference over 20 m spacing equals 0.0002 rad.','教學船廂與配重慣性力為150 kN。~The teaching caisson-counterweight inertial force is 150 kN.'],('三峽樞紐垂直升船機','Three Gorges vertical ship lift','中國','China',30.832,111.013,'Three Gorges ship lift Yichang'),['三峽升船機：齒條提升案例~Three Gorges ship lift: rack-drive context','斯特勒比升船機：纜索式比較~Strepy-Thieu boat lift: cable-drive comparison'])
 project('b228','斯特勒比—蒂厄升船機以兩座獨立船廂跨越中央運河的大高差，官方資料提供纜索式升船機與齒條式系統的比較脈絡。~Strepy-Thieu uses two independent caissons to bridge a large level difference on the Canal du Centre, providing public context for comparing cable-driven and rack-driven lifts.',[('1982','官方旅遊機構歷史摘要記錄工程於一九八二年開始。~The official tourism history summary records construction beginning in nineteen eighty-two.'),('2002','瓦隆與SOFICO官方資料確認升船機於二〇〇二年投入服務。~Walloon and SOFICO sources confirm the lift entering service in two thousand two.'),('2025','機電手冊更新提供纜索設備分析背景，並非升船機改建事件。~Updated mechanical guidance supplies cable-equipment analysis context, not a reconstruction event at the lift.')],['官方升降高差為73.15 m。~The official lift difference is 73.15 m.','官方兩座船廂可獨立運動，數量為2。~The official arrangement has 2 independently moving caissons.','SOFICO列示船廂有效長寬112 m乘12 m。~SOFICO lists useful caisson dimensions 112 m by 12 m.','教學水位差0.03 m造成36 t質量差。~Teaching level difference 0.03 m creates mass difference 36 t.','教學等效制動動能180 kJ，停止距離1.125 m。~Teaching equivalent braking energy is 180 kJ and stopping distance 1.125 m.','教學兩船廂至少一座可用率0.9975。~Teaching availability of at least one caisson is 0.9975.'],('斯特勒比蒂厄中央運河升船機','Strepy Thieu Canal du Centre lift','比利時','Belgium',50.481,4.107,'Strepy Thieu boat lift Belgium'),['斯特勒比升船機：纜索群案例~Strepy-Thieu lift: rope-group context','三峽升船機：齒條傳動比較~Three Gorges lift: rack-drive comparison'],['wallonia-lift','sofico-lift'])
 project('b229','福爾柯克水輪把兩條運河連接成連續航路，以旋轉船槽展示浮力、質量平衡與齒輪定向如何共同降低提升負擔。~The Falkirk Wheel reconnects two canals and demonstrates how displacement, balanced masses and geared orientation work together in a rotating boat lift.',[('2002','福爾柯克水輪開放，取代原先運河連接的船閘階梯功能。~The Falkirk Wheel opens, replacing the former lock-flight connection between the canals.'),('2022','水工鋼結構設計指引提供輪臂與接頭分析的比較背景。~Hydraulic steel-structure guidance provides comparison context for wheel arms and connections.'),('2025','機電指引更新供旋轉設備教育參考，並非水輪改建日期。~Updated mechanical guidance supports rotating-equipment education, not a wheel reconstruction date.')],['官方水輪於2002年開放。~The official wheel opening year is 2002.','官方35 m是兩運河高差，不能直接當水輪單獨提升量。~Official 35 m describes canal-level difference, not necessarily wheel-only lift.','教學水位差0.02 m造成4 t不平衡質量。~Teaching level difference 0.02 m creates imbalance 4 t.','教學半圈300 s、半徑12 m的速度0.12566 m/s。~Teaching half-turn 300 s at radius 12 m gives speed 0.12566 m/s.','教學完整服務能源合計2.1667 kWh，非官方數值。~Teaching full-service energy totals 2.1667 kWh, not an official value.','教學矩形空槽第一晃蕩週期9.177 s。~The teaching empty rectangular tank first sloshing period is 9.177 s.'],('福爾柯克旋轉升船水輪','Falkirk rotating boat wheel','英國','United Kingdom',55.999,-3.842,'Falkirk Wheel Scotland'),['福爾柯克水輪：旋轉提升~Falkirk Wheel: rotating-lift context','斯特勒比升船機：直線提升比較~Strepy-Thieu lift: linear-lift comparison'])
 project('b230','三角洲工程是多個防潮閘、水壩和堤防組成的區域系統，不是一座能代表所有功能的單體工程；後續三角洲計畫加入持續調適觀念。~The Delta Works form a regional system of barriers, dams and dykes rather than one structure representing every function. The later Delta Programme adds continuing adaptation.',[('1953','北海洪災促使荷蘭推動區域尺度的三角洲防洪工程。~The North Sea flood prompts a regional Dutch Delta Works protection programme.'),('1958','十月二十二日荷蘭艾瑟爾防潮閘啟用，成為首項完成工程。~The Hollandsche IJssel Barrier opens on October twenty-two as the first completed work.'),('2018','官方記錄多座防潮閘首次同時關閉，顯示系統共同面對海象。~The owner records barriers closing simultaneously for the first time, illustrating shared storm exposure.')],['官方三角洲工程包含13項主要工程。~The official Delta Works comprise 13 major works.','首項荷蘭艾瑟爾防潮閘於1958年啟用。~The first Hollandsche IJssel Barrier enters service in 1958.','教學年機率0.001的50年累積超越機率4.879%。~Teaching annual probability 0.001 gives fifty-year exceedance probability 4.879 percent.','教學三段串聯失效機率0.002997。~The teaching three-segment essential-chain failure probability is 0.002997.','教學內河暫存需求7.2 million m³。~The teaching inland temporary-storage demand is 7.2 million m³.','教學調適提前量分析要求第25年以前啟動。~The teaching adaptation lead-time analysis requires initiation by year 25.'],('澤蘭三角洲工程教育參照點','Zeeland Delta Works educational reference','荷蘭','Netherlands',51.631,3.705,'Delta Works Neeltje Jans Netherlands'),['荷蘭艾瑟爾防潮閘：早期防線~Hollandsche IJssel Barrier: early-defence context','東斯海爾德防潮閘：生態取捨比較~Eastern Scheldt Barrier: ecological-tradeoff comparison'],['rws-delta','delta-adapt'])
